{"seq":5,"slug":"idempotency-retry-compensation","title":"幂等、重试与补偿","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation","rating":{"composite":3.41,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 幂等、重试与补偿 简介\n\n在分布式系统里，网络会丢包、服务会崩溃、消息会重复，「操作恰好执行一次」是一个无法靠投递保证的幻觉。本 hub 面向构建跨服务、跨系统业务流程的后端工程师，从投递语义（恰好一次的幻觉、至少一次与去重、API 幂等键）讲起，覆盖双写问题、Outbox 模式与事件驱动一致性，Saga 与补偿事务、编排与协同，以及支付幂等、可安全重试设计与一致性权衡。贯穿全篇的主线是：接受重复必然发生，用幂等消化重复、用 Outbox 保证不丢、用补偿实现可回退，并为每个场景选择恰到好处的一致性级别。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-semantics","title":"Delivery Semantics","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exactly-once-illusion","title":"恰好一次的幻觉","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics/exactly-once-illusion","wordCount":1326,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"at-least-once-and-dedup","title":"至少一次与去重","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics/at-least-once-and-dedup","wordCount":1495,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotency-keys-in-apis","title":"API 中的幂等键","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/delivery-semantics/idempotency-keys-in-apis","wordCount":1330,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章拆穿分布式投递的核心幻觉：严格的恰好一次投递为何不可能、现实系统如何在至多一次与至少一次间选择，至少一次下如何用稳定唯一键与原子去重消化重复，以及如何把幂等键暴露到 HTTP/RPC API 边界让客户端能安全重试。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-consistency","title":"Distributed Consistency","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dual-write-problem","title":"双写问题","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency/dual-write-problem","wordCount":1347,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"outbox-pattern","title":"发件箱模式","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency/outbox-pattern","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-driven-consistency","title":"事件驱动的一致性","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/distributed-consistency/event-driven-consistency","wordCount":1531,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲跨系统的一致性：写库与发消息无法原子化的双写问题、用同事务内写 outbox 表 + 独立投递器化解它的 Outbox 模式，以及以可靠事件发布与幂等消费为支柱、用最终一致换服务自治的事件驱动一致性。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"saga-and-compensation","title":"Saga And Compensation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/saga-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-pattern","title":"Saga 模式","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/saga-and-compensation/saga-pattern","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensating-transactions","title":"补偿事务","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/saga-and-compensation/compensating-transactions","wordCount":1346,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"orchestration-vs-choreography","title":"编排与协同","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/saga-and-compensation/orchestration-vs-choreography","wordCount":1303,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲长流程的一致性：把跨服务长事务拆成本地事务序列 + 补偿的 Saga 模式、补偿作为语义逆操作（而非 rollback）的设计与「预留-确认-取消」技巧，以及编排（中心协调器）与协同（事件自驱）两种实现风格的取舍。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-resilience","title":"Applied Resilience","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/applied-resilience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"idempotency-in-payments","title":"支付场景的幂等","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/applied-resilience/idempotency-in-payments","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"retry-safety-design","title":"可安全重试的设计","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/applied-resilience/retry-safety-design","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistency-tradeoffs","title":"一致性的权衡","url":"/h/backend-engineering/idempotency-retry-compensation/applied-resilience/consistency-tradeoffs","wordCount":1401,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章把原语落到实战：支付场景如何用贯穿全链路的幂等键 + 状态机 + 对账保证「钱只动一次」、如何把每个操作设计成可安全重试（即幂等）、以及如何在一致性、可用性、延迟之间为每个场景选择恰到好处的一致性级别。\n"}]}